{"h":2857,"lines":[{"y":0.1104651165017444,"h":0.026162790201025632,"w":0.22664360046386717,"t":"Introduction","x":0.083044981735974688,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.084723767598428118,"h":0.022112959160347501,"y":0.20911592323533568,"t":"Prepare for the exam with practice tests from Cambridge","w":0.58834340413411457},{"x":0.082982633654400118,"t":"Inside you'll find four authentic examination papers from Cambridge University Press &","y":0.24748284394040454,"w":0.69046310424804691,"h":0.020196735149834666,"c":1},{"y":0.2644447422859576,"c":1,"x":0.084639074694465674,"t":"Assessment. They are the perfect way to practise - EXACTLY like the real exam.","w":0.63345403035481784,"h":0.022956195454901129},{"y":0.32120363896233362,"t":"Why are they unique?","c":1,"w":0.22491348266601563,"h":0.020366128130005823,"x":0.086505196298123088},{"y":0.35600648541735214,"x":0.086429125320556188,"w":0.70775492350260416,"t":"All our authentic practice tests go through the same design process as the IELTS test. We","h":0.020313492515355636,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.019985355806984684,"w":0.70255635579427089,"x":0.086439407485570802,"y":0.37473473082757547,"t":"check every single part of our practice tests with real students under exam conditions, to"},{"w":0.50533513387044271,"x":0.086421274423721425,"t":"make sure we give you the most authentic experience possible.","y":0.3937348484644928,"h":0.019735025975819331,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Students can take these tests on their own or with the help of a teacher to familiarise","x":0.10380622307074854,"w":0.65224914550781254,"h":0.017441861023846039,"y":0.41133720901872728},{"w":0.6453287251790365,"h":0.017441859689102501,"y":0.43023255830951845,"c":1,"t":"themselves with the exam format, understand the scoring system and practise exam","x":0.086505192622419333},{"c":1,"x":0.086505190715053235,"y":0.45203488374856793,"w":0.084775085449218759,"t":"technique.","h":0.015988371937820434},{"c":1,"x":0.088235296255339601,"w":0.20069203694661458,"t":"Further infor